    "title": "Hueytown Police pursuit lands suspect behind bars - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hannah Bazinaw ,\n3 hours ago A Hueytown Police officer was involved in a police pursuit after spotting a suspect wanted for multiple felony warrants in a Walmart parking lot. After spotting the suspect, the officer tried to make a traffic stop on his vehicle, but the suspect drove away. Officers followed them through Midfield, Briughton, on to I-59S/I-20W through Bessemer and into Tuscaloosa County where he left the interstate at Exit 100. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
